        "dinner": {
          "primary": {
            "name_base": "Siji Minfu Roast Duck - Jinrong Jie Branch (四季民福烤鸭店·金融街店) [TAKEOUT]",
            "name_local": "四季民福烤鸭店(金融街店)",
            "location_base": "Delivery to: Jade's Wudaokou Ziroom Apartment (五道口自如寓), Zhanchun Garden Bldg 18, Haidian District — from Siji Minfu Financial Street Branch: B1F, Beijing International Financial Center, No.11 Jinrong Jie, Xicheng District (~8.3 km delivery)",
            "location_local": "外卖配送至：北京市海淀区展春园18号楼（五道口自如寓）；餐厅地址：北京市西城区金融大街11号北京国际金融中心B1层",
            "coordinates": {
              "lat": 39.919263,
              "lng": 116.357643
            },
            "cost": 167,
            "currency_local": "CNY",
            "optional": false,
            "cuisine_base": "Beijing Roast Duck (外卖 Takeout)",
            "cuisine_local": "北京烤鸭（外卖）",
            "signature_dishes_base": "Open-oven Beijing roast duck (half duck takeout set), crispy skin duck pancake rolls, duck soup with mung bean noodles, cucumber and sweet bean sauce accompaniments",
            "signature_dishes_local": "明炉烤鸭（半只外卖套餐），鸭皮卷饼，绿豆鸭架汤，黄瓜丝和甜面酱",
            "notes_base": "TAKEOUT (外卖) to Jade's home. Order via Meituan (美团) or Ele.me (饿了么) from the Jinrong Jie (Financial Street) branch — the closest Siji Minfu branch to Wudaokou (~8.3 km). Siji Minfu (四季民福) is already featured in our itinerary as the Day 14 dinner at the Forbidden City branch (Rating 4.8). For delivery, the Jinrong Jie branch is the most practical pick. Order the half-duck takeout set (半只烤鸭套餐) — comes with pancake wrappers, cucumber strips, sweet bean sauce and condiments packaged separately. The open-oven crispy skin holds well for 20-30 min delivery. A real Peking duck welcome-home dinner without needing to go out. ~150-167 CNY/person. CAVEAT: Confirm delivery availability to 五道口 on Meituan app on Day 1 morning — delivery radius varies by time of day. Alternatively, any nearby Siji Minfu branch (翠微店 or 西客站店, both ~10 km) can be selected directly in the Meituan app based on live coverage.",
            "notes_local": "外卖到家。在美团或饿了么搜索\"四季民福金融街店\"，选半只烤鸭外卖套餐，附饼皮、黄瓜丝、甜面酱分开打包。配送至五道口约8.3公里，烤鸭出炉后20-30分钟内到达，鸭皮仍脆。四季民福已是行程第14天故宫店晚餐主推餐厅（评分4.8），本次外卖换用最近的金融街店。人均约150-167元。提示：当天早上在美团确认配送覆盖范围，如金融街店不在范围内可切换翠微店（复兴路33号翠微百货，同为海淀区，约10公里）或西客站店（羊坊店路18号，海淀区，约10.5公里）。",
            "image_url": "http://store.is.autonavi.com/query_pic?id=st59c23194-2049-497b-ab1e-b8f9371fcc9b&user=search&operate=original",
