              "notes_base": "TAKEOUT (外卖) via Meituan (美团). Rating 4.7 on Gaode Maps. Authentic Beijing home-cooking chain, well-known on RedNote (小红书). The braised beef rice pot (牛肉烩饭) is the standout delivery item — RedNote reviewer confirms large portion, rich broth, tender beef tendon and brisket, very satisfying for 2 people. Open 10:00-21:30. ~88 CNY/person. Order 1 beef rice pot + 1-2 stir-fry sides for a cozy home dinner. Note: Xiaodiao Litang is also featured in Day 14 lunch (Wangfujing branch) and Day 15 lunch (Ritan branch).",
