            "notes_base": "2026 Michelin Guide Beijing 1-Star + Black Pearl 2-Diamond. Rating 4.6 (Gaode Maps). RedNote verified (95 likes review by LuapZ: confirms 796 CNY/2 people, outstanding duck skin melts on tongue, house garlic paste is uniquely creamy, attentive service, staff pre-warms duck pancake plates). Hours: 11:00-14:30 / 17:00-21:00 daily. Reservation: call same morning (e.g., 10:00 for dinner slot) — walk-ins also possible but may wait. Located in Sanlitun — easy taxi from Great Wall return bus stops. Perfect Michelin reward dinner after an exhausting but exhilarating Great Wall day. Budget CNY 350-450/person (avoid overpriced mineral water: order tap/free water instead).",
            "notes_local": "2026北京米其林指南一星+黑珍珠二钻。高德评分4.6。小红书验证（95赞，LuapZ实探：2人796元，鸭皮蘸白糖即化，蒜泥creamy质感独特，服务员提前换加热餐碟保温）。营业时间：11:00-14:30 / 17:00-21:00。预订：当天早上10点左右电话预约晚餐位置，也可现场等位。三里屯位置，从长城返程专车站打车方便。长城日后的米其林犒赏晚餐。人均350-450元（注意矿泉水价高，喝免费茶水）。",
