            "notes_base": "Rating 4.7 on Gaode Maps — the highest-rated restaurant in the Huayan Temple Square area. Opens 11:00-14:30 and 17:30-22:00 (dinner service). Located directly inside Huayan Temple Square, walking distance from hotel (高渡精品酒店). Yanggao County (阳高县) lamb is famous throughout Shanxi — rich flavour, tender texture, no gamey smell. Lamb offal soup (羊杂) is a quintessential Datong cold-night warming dish. Perfect cozy dinner after full afternoon of temple sightseeing. CNY 38/person. Arrive by 17:30 for the best seating.",
            "notes_local": "高德评分4.7，大同华严寺广场区域最高评分餐厅。11:00-14:30及17:30-22:00营业（晚餐）。位于华严寺广场内，距高渡精品酒店步行即达。阳高县羊肉是山西知名特产，鲜嫩无膻。羊杂汤是大同最暖胃的传统夜饭。游完古城三大寺庙后最佳收尾晚餐，人均38元，17:30后开始营业。",
