            "notes_base": "Rating 4.7 — one of the highest-rated Shaanxi cuisine restaurants in the city center. A beloved local gem on a historic lane near the Bell Tower area. The name '三根电杆' (Three Electric Poles) is a quirky local landmark reference. Elevated, stylish interpretation of traditional Shaanxi recipes without being a tourist trap. Opens 11:00-21:30. CNY 66/person. Perfect dinner after the Muslim Quarter evening exploration nearby. Verified via Gaode Maps. Recommended in XHS 西安小众美食 post (216 likes, 小院餐厅 category).",
            "notes_local": "评分4.7，西安市区评分最高的创意陕菜馆之一，钟楼附近古街西木头市109号，店名因附近三根老电线杆而得名，本地人心头好。非旅游圈，有范儿有腔调，11:00-21:30营业，人均66元。回民街晚游归来绝佳晚餐。高德验证，小红书「西安小众美食」帖收录（216赞）。",
